    "chunk_text": "he by\u00f0 Ianuarii. \u00dea o\u00f0re healda\u00f0 heora gewunan. De Tertio Anno Endecadis. On \u00feam \u00feriddan endecade beo\u00f0 syx & twentig epacte. \u00deises geres ne miht \u00feu gemetan \u00fe\u00e6s embolismus mon\u00f0es epactas buton \u00feu nyme \u00fe\u00e6s o\u00f0res geares \u00de\u00e6s \u00e6rran geares epacte w\u00e6ron fiftyne, for\u00feon w\u00e6s se mona on kl Augusti xxix, & \u00fe\u00e6r he w\u00e6s So\u00f0lice se \u00f0e on quarta non Augusti ongin\u00f0 & geenda\u00f0 \u00ferittig nihta eald on pridie kl Septembris, On kl Septembris & Octobris, \u00feurh syx & xx epactas, by\u00f0 se mona anre nihte eald. Cetere ordinem suum deinceps sequuntur, \u00fe\u00e6t ys on Englisc \u00fea o\u00f0re mon\u00f0as sy\u00f0\u00f0an fara\u00f0 \u00e6fter De Quarto Anno Endecadis. Nu we habba\u00f0 ymbe \u00feas embolismus gesprecen, uton nu ymbe \u00feone seofo\u00f0an embolismum Witodlice on \u00feam ytemestan geare \u00fe\u00e6s endecades synt eahtatyne epacte; for\u00f0on September & For\u00fean we do\u00f0 ane ylde \u00feam monan on Aprili & Maio, for\u00fean se mona \u00fee by\u00f0 on kl Aprilis xxviii, & se mona \u00fee on pridie N Aprelis by\u00f0 agunnen niwe & by\u00f0 geglenged eall o\u00f0 vi N Mai nigon & Se mona \u00fee ongin\u00f0 niwe on v N Mai & by\u00f0 geendod \u00ferittig nihta eald on kl Iunii, he by\u00f0 Maius & se mona \u00fee ongin\u00f0 niwe on quarta N Iunii, & by\u00f0 geendod xxix on pridie kl Iulii, he by\u00f0 his & se mona \u00fee by\u00f0",
